#: views/accounts/register/provider-signin.hbs:21
msgid ""
"This appears to be a Microsoft mailbox. Sign in with Microsoft to connect "
"it. Password sign-in over IMAP is no longer supported."
msgstr ""
"Dies scheint ein Microsoft-Postfach zu sein. Melden Sie sich mit Microsoft "
